{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormidi"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The IvorMIDI framework provides MIDI channel message, system message, and data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value types written in Swift. Channel messages cover note on and off,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"polyphonic and channel pressure, control change, program change, and pitch","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bend change; system messages cover system exclusive, system common, and system","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"real-time messages. Channel and system messages, and the data values they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carry, can be converted to and from their ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/midi.org\/midi-1-0","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wire encoding.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Registered (RPN) and non-registered (NRPN) parameters, such as pitch bend","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sensitivity and fine tuning, can be set with a single call that builds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whole control change sequence. Universal system exclusive messages for master","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"volume, master tuning, and all of the MIDI Tuning Standard are built the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"way, as are the bank select and program change messages that set a channel to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIPatch","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningMessage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" decodes MIDI Tuning Standard messages.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIPitchBend","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" can be made from a bend in cents and the synthesizer’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pitch bend sensitivity.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import IvorMIDI","","\/\/ Middle C, velocity 100, on channel 1.","let noteOn = MIDIChannelMessage.noteOn(1, 60, 100)","","noteOn.statusByte   \/\/ 0x90","noteOn.dataBytes    \/\/ [0x3C, 0x64]","","\/\/ Decode a message from its wire encoding.","let decoded = MIDIChannelMessage(statusByte: 0x90,","                                 dataBytes: [0x3c, 0x64])","","decoded == noteOn   \/\/ true"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/UsingIvorMIDI","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for a full guide to the messages, the data values, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the wire encoding.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"IvorMIDI"}],"externalID":"IvorMIDI","title":"IvorMIDI","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"blue"}},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/UsingIvorMIDI"],"title":"Guides","anchor":"Guides"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIChannelMessage","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDISystemMessage","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningMessage"],"title":"Messages","anchor":"Messages"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIChannel","do